{"id": "47", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is also on the bias.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the type of quilt and the folding method recommended for that type.\nDetermine the size and shape of the quilt to ensure it can be folded into the desired dimensions.\nAssess the materials used in the quilt to ensure they are suitable for folding without causing damage or loss of integrity.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 15.807, "generation_time_seconds": 13.419, "selection_time_seconds": 2.3814, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 2856, 15336, 315, 279, 60736, 25, 29901, 279, 2374, 323, 3084, 315, 279, 60736, 311, 5978, 432, 374, 47035, 34901, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.7532, -0.0007, -0.0031, -3.9441, -3.1554, -0.2105, -0.0007, -0.001, -3.5557, -0.1866, -0.0073, -0.8129, -0.0013, -0.0204, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.0035, -0.2169, -2.2349, -1.5625, -1.3471, -0.1156, -1.898, -0.5837, -0.0399], "cumulative_logprob": -21.6556, "norm_logp": -0.8662, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 25, "avg_logp": -0.8662225008010864}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 943, 315, 60736, 323, 279, 44742, 1714, 11102, 369, 429, 943, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 15