{"id": "55", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "You can prevent birds from building nests on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch and the top of the porch if it has open rafters. This will block the birds from reaching spaces they often choose to build their nests. If you have a light fixture, you can also install bird netting over it, but make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs and doesn't entangle birds. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as this can scare birds away. Remember to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe passage does not provide any specific methods for preventing birds from building nests on a porch. It only poses the question.\nThe question asks for methods to prevent birds from nesting on a porch.\nThere is no information provided about methods or techniques to prevent birds from nesting on a porch. The passage only asks a question about how to prevent this behavior.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 22.519, "generation_time_seconds": 19.8507, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6608, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [5501, 3410, 279, 9760, 46769, 311, 23643, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-4.736, -0.0647, -0.0107, -3.9616, -1.4715, -1.4113, -0.1716, -0.3835, -0.0006, -27.0833, -18.0912, -8.6