{"id": "79", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a brief guide on how to cook brats:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grate.\n3. Combine beer, onions, red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper in a large pot. Bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\n5. Reduce heat to medium and cook for 10 to 12 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and place them on the preheated grill.\n7. Cook the bratwurst for 5 to 10 minutes, turning once.\n8. Serve the bratwurst with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\n\nSo, to cook brats, you first prepare the grill, then cook the bratwurst in a beer mixture before grilling them until they're done.", "pred": "Prepare the brats by cleaning and seasoning them before cooking.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Prepare the brats by cleaning and seasoning them before cooking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nWhat is the first step in cooking brats?\nThe first step in cooking brats is to prepare the brats.\nWhat does it mean to prepare the brats?\nPreparing the brats involves cleaning and seasoning them before cooking.\n\nAnswer: Prepare the brats by cleaning and seasoning them before cooking.", "time_sec": 22.02, "generation_time_seconds": 19.2745, "selection_time_seconds": 2.7383, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 943, 315, 1411, 1862, 1660, 29105, 320, 68, 1302, 2572, 58886, 11, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 8, 323, 279, 14890, 17233, 1714, 320, 68, 1302, 2572, 1081, 9400, 11, 7215, 2220, 27509, 11, 27815, 568, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.224, -0.0007, -0.0147, -1.0873, -0.0056, -0.0006, -0.1427, -1.1346, -0.1164, -1.4602, -0.0016, 0.0, -0.0002, -3.4556, -0.2881, -0.3267, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -0.8941, -0.6171, -0.7068, -1.4648, -0.0658, -0.0036,