{"id": "109", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the Windward Islands are located in the southeastern part of the Caribbean Sea and are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies), while the Leeward Islands are located in the northwestern part of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind (\"lee\"). The main difference between them is their exposure to the wind and the resulting climate. The Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter due to their exposure to the wind, while the Leeward Islands are drier but still get rain.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe first step is to identify the specific details provided in the passage about the Leeward and Windward islands.\nThe second step is to analyze the information provided about the Leeward and Windward islands.\nThe third step is to compare the information about the Leeward and Windward islands to determine what the difference is between them.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.088, "generation_time_seconds": 16.4597, "selection_time_seconds": 2.611, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 512, 24035, 29000, 323, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 1745, 304, 862, 52901, 3728, 323, 9977, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.8176, -2.7419, -0.0, -2.3885, -1.0796, -0.5064, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -5.635, -0.0602, -0.3587, -0.572, -0.6497, -0.4095, -0.6665, -0.179, -0.8149, -29.375, -25.8333, -15.629, -8.6118, -8.7656, -10.425, -7.7376, -6.2174, -6.3957, -6.5546, -5.8809, -6.5516, -6.5535, -5.101, -3.9