{"id": "467", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "pred": "Hiking as a hobby offers various benefits, including physical exercise and mental relaxation. Hiking can improve cardiovascular health, build strength, and increase flexibility. It also reduces stress and anxiety, leading to a more peaceful state of mind. Moreover, it allows individuals to connect with nature and enjoy its beauty, which can be incredibly therapeutic.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Hiking as a hobby offers various benefits, including physical exercise and mental relaxation. Hiking can improve cardiovascular health, build strength, and increase flexibility. It also reduces stress and anxiety, leading to a more peaceful state of mind. Moreover, it allows individuals to connect with nature and enjoy its beauty, which can be incredibly therapeutic.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nReview the given passage to identify the benefits of hiking as a hobby and extract relevant details to support your answer.\nAfter analyzing the passage, I have identified several benefits of hiking as a hobby. These benefits include physical exercise, mental relaxation, and the opportunity to connect with nature. The passage suggests that hiking can improve cardiovascular health, build strength, and increase flexibility. It also mentions that hiking can reduce stress and anxiety, leading to a more peaceful state of mind. Additionally, hiking allows individuals to enjoy the beauty of nature, which can be incredibly therapeutic.\nBased on the analysis of the passage, the next logical reasoning step is to summarize the identified benefits of hiking as a hobby. This summary will provide a clear and concise answer to the question.\n\nAnswer: Hiking as a hobby offers various benefits, including physical exercise and mental relaxation. Hiking can improve cardiovascular health, build strength, and increase flexibility. It also reduces stress and anxiety, leading to a more peaceful state of mind. Moreover, it allows individuals to connect with nature and enjoy its beauty, which can be incredibly therapeutic.", "time_sec": 30.735, "generation_time_seconds": 27.6104, "selection_time_seconds": 3.115, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 3151, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.4337, -0.0013, -2.4263, -0.1372, -0.5165, -0.0, -1.1657, -0.0697, -0.0, -4.5792, -0.0037, -28.3333, -25.625, -14.8966, -12.0956, -12.3106, -13.5427, -9.1713, -6.2951, -7.5062, -8.1273, -5.9542, -5.4923], "cumulative_logprob": -159.6835, "norm_logp": -6.9428, "input_len": 140, "output_tokens": 23, "avg_logp": -6.942757606506348}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 1447, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.3296, -1.0955, -0.0438, -0.0555, -0.4224, -Infinity, -32.2917, -22.7083, -14.7941, -11.095, -12.4449, -11.3579, -11.9228, -12.7452, -12.7173, -11.671, -10.6337, -10.2267, -8.0452, -6.