{"id": "709", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is the answer to the question:\n\nThe colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings:\n\n* White represents purity\n* Blue represents patriotism\n* Red represents the willingness to shed blood during warfare\n\nThe three white stars on the flag represent the three grand divisions of Tennessee: East, Middle, and West. The blue field with the white stars is meant to symbolize the three divisions bound together as one.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe given passage does not provide any information about the colors of the Tennessee flag or their meanings.\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 18.774, "generation_time_seconds": 16.2247, "selection_time_seconds": 2.5415, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 21085, 1558, 537, 6644, 894, 1995, 911, 279, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 476, 862, 49700, 13, 15277, 11, 358, 4157, 4226, 279, 3405, 1667, 1172, 279, 1995, 3897, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.909, -1.9051, -0.0212, -0.0116, -0.0, -2.791, -0.154, -0.0244, -0.0145, -0.001, -0.314, -0.002, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0669, -0.4298, -0.0077, -0.0005, -1.1183, -0.0003, -0.7156, -0.0505, -1.3583, -0.1186, -0.0, -1.3545, -0.1186, -0.0023, -0.0093, -0.5945, -1.2077, -0.0157], "cumulative_logprob": -13.3173, "norm_logp": -0.4036, "input_len": 143, "output_tokens": 33, "avg_logp": -0.40355202555656433}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 7987, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 624, 785, 23219, 5181, 702, 2326, 16202