{"id": "38", "question": "how to cook pollock?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to cook pollock:\n\nPreheat the oven to 350°F (175°C). Season the pollock fillets with paprika and black pepper. Place the fillets on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper or aluminum foil. You can also add sliced onions, green peppers, and tomatoes on top of the fillets. Bake for 15 minutes or until the fish flakes easily with a fork. If desired, top with cheese and return to the oven for an additional 3 minutes or until the cheese is melted.\n\nTherefore, the answer is not \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps are:\nTo provide a comprehensive answer, I need to examine the given passages for information on cooking pollock. If there are no specific instructions or examples provided in the passages, I will be unable to answer based on the given information.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nTo provide a comprehensive answer, I need to examine the given passages for information on cooking pollock. If there are no specific instructions or examples provided in the passages, I will be unable to answer based on the given information.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 25.298, "generation_time_seconds": 22.5948, "selection_time_seconds": 2.691, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 510, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 1376, 13966, 323, 17233, 5413, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 624, 17, 13, 9192, 369, 3151, 11221, 476, 10295, 5435, 311, 17233, 1471, 1023, 624, 18, 13, 37427, 2986, 279, 17975, 7354, 323, 17233, 3039, 3897, 304, 279, 9760, 46769, 624, 19, 13, 23153, 26887, 279, 1995, 311, 1855, 264, 4583, 17233, 1714, 369, 14