{"id": "48", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, also on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n\nThese steps will result in a neatly folded quilt with four even corners. Note that the size of the quilt is not specified in the passages, so these steps can be applied to quilts of any size.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe passages provided do not contain any information specifically about how to fold a quilt. They do not mention the process, tools, or techniques involved in folding a quilt. Therefore, I cannot provide a step-by-step guide or specific examples on how to fold a quilt based on the given information.\nThe passages do not provide information on the process of folding a quilt, so there are no steps, tools, or techniques mentioned within the given text.\nThe given passage does not provide any details on how to fold a quilt.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 24.105, "generation_time_seconds": 21.4789, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6144, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 46769, 3897, 653, 537, 6644, 894, 1995, 11689, 911, 1246, 311, 11555, 264, 60736, 13, 2379, 653, 537, 6286, 279, 1882, 11, 7375, 11, 476, 12538, 6398, 304, 44742, 264, 60736, 13, 15277, 11, 358, 4157, 3410, 264, 3019, 14319, 29208, 8474, 476, 3151, 10295, 389, 1246, 311,