{"id": "57", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "To prevent birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves and top of your porch with staples. Additionally, you can install bird netting over your light fixture to deter birds from accessing it. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. It's important to note that any product used to deter birds should be nonflammable and safe to use.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe given passage does not provide specific steps on how to prevent birds from building nests on a porch.\nConsider common methods such as using bird deterrents, installing netting, or creating physical barriers to discourage birds from nesting on the porch.\nThe given passage does not mention any methods to prevent birds from building nests on a porch.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 27.964, "generation_time_seconds": 24.7602, "selection_time_seconds": 3.1917, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645