{"id": "102", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to sync audiobooks from iPhone to iTunes:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. Click on the \"Audiobooks\" tab on the left side of the iTunes window.\n4. Check the boxes next to the audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them to your iPhone.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to finish the syncing process.\n\nAlternatively, you can use Syncios Audiobook Transfer to transfer audiobooks from your computer to your iOS device. To do this, follow these steps:\n\n1. Launch Syncios Audiobook Transfer on your computer.\n2. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n3. Click on the \"Books\" tab on the top menu bar.\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from your computer to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Import\" button to transfer the selected audiobooks to your iPhone.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "pred": "The specific method for syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps: 1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable. 2. Open iTunes on your computer. 3. In iTunes, go to the \"File\" menu and select \"Add to Library\" to import your audiobooks. 4. Once the audiobooks have been added to iTunes, you can drag and drop them into the \"Podcasts\" section. 5. To sync your audiobooks to your iPhone, go to the \"File\" menu in iTunes and select \"Sync Podcasts.\" 6. In the \"Sync Podcasts\" window, you can choose which audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone. 7. Click \"Sync\" to start the syncing process.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "The specific method for syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In iTunes, go to the \"File\" menu and select \"Add to Library\" to import your audiobooks.\n4. Once the audiobooks have been added to iTunes, you can drag and drop them into the \"Podcasts\" section.\n5. To sync your audiobooks to your iPhone, go to the \"File\" menu in iTunes and select \"Sync Podcasts.\"\n6. In the \"Sync Podcasts\" window, you can choose which audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone.\n7. Click \"Sync\" to start the syncing process.\n\nThese steps will sync your audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes, allowing you to access them on your computer.\n\nAnswer: The specific method for syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps: 1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable. 2. Open iTunes on your computer. 3. In iTunes, go to the \"File\" menu and select \"Add to Library\" to import your audiobooks. 4. Once the audiobooks have been added to iTunes, you can drag and drop them into the \"Podcasts\" section. 5. To sync your audiobooks to your iPhone, go to the \"File\" menu in iTunes and select \"Sync Podcasts.\" 6. In the \"Sync Podcasts\" window, you can choose which audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone. 7. Click \"Sync\" to start the syncing process.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific syncing method for audiobooks from the iPhone to iTunes.\nResearch the steps involved in syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, focusing on the specific methods that apply to audiobooks.\nResearch the specific syncing method for audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, focusing on the method that applies to audiobooks.\n\nThe specific method for syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In iTunes, go to the \"File\" menu and select \"Add to Library\" to import your audiobooks.\n4. Once the audiobooks have been added to iTunes, you can drag and drop them into the \"Podcasts\" section.\n5. To sync your audiobooks to your iPhone, go to the \"File\" menu in iTunes and select \"Sync Podcasts.\"\n6. In the \"Sync Podcasts\" window, you can choose which audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone.\n7. Click \"Sync\" to start the syncing process.\n\nThese steps will sync your audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes, allowing you to access them on your computer.\n\nAnswer: The specific method for syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps: 1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable. 2. Open iTunes on your computer. 3. In iTunes, go to the \"File\" menu and select \"Add to Library\" to import your audiobooks. 4. Once the audiobooks have been added to iTunes, you can drag and drop them into the \"Podcasts\" section. 5. To sync your audiobooks to your iPhone, go to the \"File\" menu in iTunes and select \"Sync Podcasts.\" 6. In the \"Sync Podcasts\" window, you can choose which audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone. 7. Click \"Sync\" to start the syncing process.", "time_sec": 30.455, "generation_time_seconds": 27.7155, "selection_time_seconds": 2.7312, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 96145, 1714, 369, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 279, 12167, 311, 13025, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645,