{"id": "111", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the main difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is their exposure to the wind and precipitation. The Windward Islands are exposed to the northeasterly trade winds and receive more rainfall, making them wetter and more humid, while the Leeward Islands are located on the leeward side of the mountains and receive less rainfall, making them drier. Therefore, the answer to the question is:\n\nThe Windward Islands are wetter and more humid due to their exposure to the northeasterly trade winds, while the Leeward Islands are drier and receive less rainfall.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the geographical characteristics of the two types of islands mentioned in the question.\nAnalyze the climate and weather patterns affecting each type of island.\nAnalyze the topography and vegetation of the leeward and windward sides of the islands.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 18.938, "generation_time_seconds": 16.1006, "selection_time_seconds": 2.8301, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 21085, 1558, 537, 3410, 894, 1995, 911, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 29000, 13, 15277, 11, 358, 4157, 4226, 279, 3405, 3118, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.8176, -1.4919, -0.5111, -0.019, -0.0, -0.0817, -1.2552, -0.3787, -0.0598, -0.0007, -0.1729, -0.0, -0.0068, -3.5702, -0.0, -0.0045, -0.0021, 0.0, -0.3022, -0.0038, -0.817, -0.0005, -0.5045, -0.0809, -0.2178, -0.1773, -0.0, -0.3193, -0.0126, -0.010