{"id": "256", "question": "how to clean dryer vent", "gt": "To clean your dryer vent, follow these steps:\n\n1. Remove the outside cover on the vent.\n2. Use a special lint brush with an extendable handle to clean the inside of the pipe.\n3. If possible, remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there as well.\n4. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter and clean it thoroughly.\n5. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 1: Identify the materials needed for cleaning the dryer vent.\nStep 2: Explain how to access the dryer vent.\nStep 3: Describe the process of cleaning the dryer vent.\nStep 3: Describe the process of cleaning the dryer vent.\nStep 4: Discuss the importance of regular cleaning for the dryer vent.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 18.649, "generation_time_seconds": 16.0017, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6395, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 943, 315, 46622, 323, 1181, 10378, 6546, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.5187, -0.001, -0.0208, -0.8382, -0.0189, -0.0025, -2.6089, -0.8372, -0.6257, -1.4287, -0.2191, -0.0213, -30.8333, -21.2501, -9.8, -18.75, -10.6405, -12.2359, -15.2092, -12.0849, -10.2108, -9.1714, -8.7631, -8.2435, -8.1544, -6.8432, -5.6834, -3.6978, -5.0363, -4.8426, -5.6605, -5.67, -5.0495, -5.7359, -6.4984, -7.5085, -6.6711, -5.8511, -4.4127, -4.1542], "cumulative_logprob": -266.8033, "norm_logp": -6.6701, "input_len": 138, "out