{"id": "271", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe passage does not provide a list of the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nThe passage does not specify any signs or symptoms of pregnancy.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 22.468, "generation_time_seconds": 19.8332, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6255, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 3897, 46769, 369, 894, 6286, 315, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 13, 64547, 3151, 10295, 11, 5109, 11, 476, 35495, 5435, 311, 1493, 13495, 13, 1416, 279, 46769, 6644, 9760, 1995, 11, 990, 432, 311, 1352, 264, 11682, 2033, 13, 1416, 279, 46769, 6853, 14016, 1995, 11, 1584, 429, 498, 525, 11889, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.5237, -0.0076, -0.9193, -0.2141, -0.4434, -0.225, -0.8419, -0.0003, -0.6579, -0.0013, -0.0009, -0.0046, -0.0, -0.0015, -0.0, -0.0935, -1.8582, -0.7203, -0.3528, -0.0291, -0.0013, -0.0, -0.002, -0.0003, -0.3627, 0.0, -0.0254, -0.704, -0.0276, -2.1235, -0.0932, -0.1024, -1.