{"id": "436", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use the website www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages. Enter the last name of the person in the \"Nom\" field and optionally enter their first name in the \"Prenom\" field. If you know the address, you can enter it in the \"Ou\" section. Leave it blank if you don't know the address. Click on \"Trouver\" to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number of the matching listings.", "pred": "To find someone in France, first identify the target person and their location in France. Determine if the person is a public figure or a private individual. Check if the person has a known residence or workplace in France. Utilize legal and ethical means to access the information. Consider alternative methods if direct access is not possible. Evaluate the privacy laws and regulations in France. Assess the potential consequences of attempting to find the person. Make a decision based on the above steps.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: To find someone in France, first identify the target person and their location in France. Determine if the person is a public figure or a private individual. Check if the person has a known residence or workplace in France. Utilize legal and ethical means to access the information. Consider alternative methods if direct access is not possible. Evaluate the privacy laws and regulations in France. Assess the potential consequences of attempting to find the person. Make a decision based on the above steps.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 1: Identify the target person and their location in France.\nStep 2: Determine if the person is a public figure or a private individual.\nStep 3: Check if the person has a known residence or workplace in France.\nStep 4: Utilize legal and ethical means to access the information.\nStep 5: Consider alternative methods if direct access is not possible.\nStep 6: Evaluate the privacy laws and regulations in France.\nStep 7: Assess the potential consequences of attempting to find the person.\nStep 8: Make a decision based on the above steps.\nStep 3: Check if the person has a known residence or workplace in France.\nStep 4: Utilize legal and ethical means to access the information.\n\nAnswer: To find someone in France, first identify the target person and their location in France. Determine if the person is a public figure or a private individual. Check if the person has a known residence or workplace in France. Utilize legal and ethical means to access the information. Consider alternative methods if direct access is not possible. Evaluate the privacy laws and regulations in France. Assess the potential consequences of attempting to find the person. Make a decision based on the above steps.", "time_sec": 27.24, "generation_time_seconds": 23.9347, "selection_time_seconds": 3.2931, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 5257, 5413, 11649, 389, 279, 2500, 1995, 498, 614, 13, 1416, 498, 1414, 279, 1697, 594, 829, 323, 264, 3151, 3728, 11, 498, 646, 2711, 2860, 476, 990, 3590, 3687, 15409, 1075, 5573, 11, 13991, 11, 476, 32767, 13, 1416, 498, 614, 862, 3645, 1995, 11, 1741, 438, 264, 4540, 1372, 476, 2551, 2621, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 8098, 1105, 476, 11628, 1105, 458, 2551, 13, 1416, 498, 525, 3330, 369, 4325, 304, 264, 3151, 3283, 476, 5537, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 16721, 2205, 3942, 18652, 476, 20186, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 8498, 448, 2205, 10826, 476, 9675, 304, 279, 3082, 498, 525, 15039, 369, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.823, -0.0648, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0036, -0.431, -0.1458, -0.636, -0.6954, -0.0081, -0.6907, 0.0, -0.0211, -2.8092, -0.0075, -2.5732, -0.0002, -0.9628, -0.631, -0.0007, -0.8029, -0.3619, 