{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "Hiking as a hobby offers numerous benefits including improved physical health, mental well-being, and the opportunity to connect with nature. Hiking can lead to better cardiovascular health, stronger muscles, and increased endurance through regular activity. Mentally, it provides stress relief and can enhance mood through exposure to natural environments. Socially, hiking in groups can foster community connections and shared experiences.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Hiking as a hobby offers numerous benefits including improved physical health, mental well-being, and the opportunity to connect with nature. Hiking can lead to better cardiovascular health, stronger muscles, and increased endurance through regular activity. Mentally, it provides stress relief and can enhance mood through exposure to natural environments. Socially, hiking in groups can foster community connections and shared experiences.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific benefits of hiking that are mentioned in the passages.\nRead through the given passages to find explicit mentions of the benefits of hiking as a hobby.\nLook for sentences or phrases that directly state the benefits of hiking, such as physical, mental, or social advantages.\n\nAnswer: Hiking as a hobby offers numerous benefits including improved physical health, mental well-being, and the op