{"id": "504", "question": "what are the characteristics of tropical rainforest floor", "gt": "The floor of a tropical rainforest biome is characterized by a fast rate of decay due to the heat and moisture. This decay provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow. Various types of fruits, nuts, herbs, and mushrooms grow on the rainforest floor. Additionally, vines and ferns grow all over the rainforest, including the floor, helping to connect the various layers of the biome.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe passage does not mention anything about the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor.\nThe passage does not mention anything about the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor.\nThe passage does not mention anything about the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 22.495, "generation_time_seconds": 19.812, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6729, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 17452, 315, 279, 34048, 11174, 50655, 6422, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 26305, 894, 4911, 4419, 11, 279, 9362, 315, 3654, 10779, 476, 9898, 11, 323, 894, 12158, 9363, 429, 16792, 311, 1181, 28583, 11094, 476, 729, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.1054