{"id": "737", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "Based on the given passages, SMS stands for Short Message Service and allows you to send a message of up to 160 characters to another device. In contrast, MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows you to send a message including pictures, videos, sounds, text, or any combination of the four. The content of an MMS message has a maximum size of 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, GIF, etc.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the differences between SMS and MMS services based on the information provided in the passages.\nIdentify key features of SMS and MMS mentioned in the passages.\nIdentify the main differences in functionality between SMS and MMS as described in the passages, focusing on how they handle text, multimedia content, and sending/receiving processes.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 24.431, "generation_time_seconds": 21.7914, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6298, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1376, 11799, 1948, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 198, 12, 29909, 320, 12472, 4856, 5362, 8, 323, 386, 4826, 320, 40404, 26936, 73170, 5362, 8, 525, 2176, 6371, 29522, 3516, 11, 714, 807, 1745, 304, 279, 4494, 315, 6605, 807, 646, 3624, 624, 12, 29909, 6147, 3847, 311, 3624, 323, 5258, 1467, 6605, 11, 1393, 386, 4826, 6147, 3847, 311, 3624, 323, 5258, 56513, 2213, 1741, 438, 9185, 11, 6803, 11, 323, 7699, 3542, 382], "logp_list": [-2.2756, -0.001, -0.0094, -0.0002, -0.3315, -0.0427, -0.0872, -0.9742, -0.0146, -0.0, -0.0232, -0.0, 0.0, -3.7125, -1.0835, -0.0083, -0.7221, -0.0, -0.0013, -0.0, -0.0741, -2.9607, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0177, 0.0, -0.0791, -0.0, -0.0003, 