{"id": "620", "question": "how has it technology changed the workplace", "gt": "IT technology has significantly changed the workplace in several ways. It has improved efficiency and increased productivity, as it allows for a complete shift in how time is spent in the modern workplace. The continuous evolution of technology also changes how business is conducted and the dynamics of the workplace. Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has drastically changed attitudes and processes in the workplace. Technology has also dramatically reshaped the average American workplace, allowing employees to interact with a global market and take work on the road.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe given passage does not provide information on how technology has changed the workplace.\nThe passages do not contain sufficient information to answer the question.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 20.282, "generation_time_seconds": 18.0266, "selection_time_seconds": 2.2471, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 3405, 17064, 911, 1246, 5440, 702, 5497, 279, 26368, 13, 2014, 4226, 419, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 10542, 3151, 10295, 11, 5109, 11, 476, 35495, 504, 279, 2661, 21085, 429, 19869, 29016, 4344, 304, 279, 26368, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.0447, -1.1741, -0.0196, -0.3802, -0.1023, -0.0175, -0.0, -0.0014, -0.0, -0.0, -0.081, -0.1333, -0.3026, -0.0113, -0.0043, -1.8613, -0.047, -0.0015, -0.3859, -0.0964, -0.5501, -0.6207