{"id": "73", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you:\n\n1. Physical contact: Avoid physical contact that could be misinterpreted as fondling or sexual activity (Passage 1).\n2. Eye contact: If your coworker is consistently staring at you, it may be a sign that they are interested in you (Passage 2).\n3. Smiling: If your coworker smiles at you excessively, even when there is no apparent reason to do so, it may be a sign of flirtation (Passage 2).\n4. Seeking contact: If your coworker consistently finds reasons to be near you or seek you out discreetly, it may indicate that they have feelings for you (Passage 3).\n\nHowever, it is essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean that your coworker is interested in you romantically. It's important to pay attention to the context of their behavior and communicate openly to avoid misunderstandings.\n\nIf you are unsure about your coworker's intentions, it may be best to avoid physical contact and observe their behavior over time before making any conclusions. Additionally, it's crucial to respect your coworker's boundaries and maintain a professional work environment.", "pred": "To determine if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs of physical attraction and specific physical actions or behaviors that indicate interest or attraction. These can include prolonged eye contact, frequent smiles, or close proximity when speaking.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "To determine if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs of physical attraction and specific physical actions or behaviors that indicate interest or attraction. These can include prolonged eye contact, frequent smiles, or close proximity when speaking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nLook for signs of physical attraction from your male coworker.\nLook for specific physical actions or behaviors that indicate interest or attraction.\nLook for specific physical actions or behaviors that indicate interest or attraction, such as prolonged eye contact, frequent smiles, or close proximity when speaking.\n\nTo determine if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs of physical attraction and specific physical actions or behaviors that indicate interest or attraction. These can include prolonged eye contact, frequent smiles, or close proximity when speaking.", "time_sec": 19.973, "generation_time_seconds": 17.2644, "selection_time_seconds": 2.701, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [10380, 369, 11929, 315, 2734, 304, 697, 6961, 11094, 476, 4345, 3550, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 421, 566, 13814, 28627, 806, 3579, 476, 10780, 304, 697, 9362, 11, 432, 1231, 13216, 2734, 13, 22406, 11, 2908, 279, 11639, 323, 8090, 315, 806, 6529, 15540, 6974, 498, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.6971, -0.0438, -0.7651, -0.0342, -4.1002, -0.5002, -0.3302, -0.9069, -0.0109, -2.172, -1.1798, -0.0144, -0.0618, -1.7748, -0.0351, -0.0001, -0.5425, -1.212, -0.3999, -2.0733, -1.1616, -0.0262, -0.5808, -3.0848, -3.138, -0.5024, -0.0004, -0.0608, -0.367, -2.1027, -0.3358, -3.7188, -0.1721, -2.4646, 0.0, -3.0049, -1.7415, -0.2759, -0.4291, -0.322, -0.0, -0.3267, -1.6345, -1.6542, -0.0727, -0.0001, -0.0645, -0.4436], "cumulative_logprob": -44.54, "norm_logp": -0.9279, "input_len": 145, "output_tokens": 48, "avg_logp": -0.9279233813285828}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 3151, 6961, 6168, 476, 27099, 429, 2578, 13216, 52630, 367, 11, 1741, 438, 7912, 3645, 11, 36063, 11, 476, 3259, 2118, 71639, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.6763, -0.0036, 