{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "Push-ups, chest presses, and flyes.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Push-ups, chest presses, and flyes.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 2: Identify specific exercises that target the chest muscles, such as push-ups, chest presses, and flyes.\nStep 3: Provide additional details on how each exercise specifically works the chest, such as the movement of the arms and the engagement of the chest muscles.\nStep 4: Explain the importance of consistency and proper form in performing these exercises to maximize chest muscle toning.\n\nPush-ups, chest presses, and flyes.", "time_sec": 24.663, "generation_time_seconds": 21.8247, "selection_time_seconds": 2.8301, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 943, 315, 10158, 429, 11689, 11550, 279, 15138, 23648, 624, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 21144, 22932, 429, 16579, 279, 281, 1256, 278, 23648, 323, 279, 14590, 23648, 369, 264, 15817, 15138, 25242, 624, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 54115, 421, 279, 2661, 46769, 3410, 1995, 389, 3151, 22932, 369, 279, 15138, 624, 8304, 220, 19, 25, 29901, 421, 279, 3405, 646, 387, 18577, 3118, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 624, 8304, 220, 20, 25, 1416, 279, 46769, 653, 537, 3410, 14016, 1995, 11, 3410, 458, 8311, 2033, 624, 8304, 220, 21, 25, 3377, 6334, 279, 4226, 3118, 389, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.4404, -0.0011, -0.0245, -0.0002, -0.0211, -0.0442, -1.3273, -0.0, -0.2132, -0.