{"id": "22", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "gt": "Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia's Medicaid and FAMIS programs. They ensure the delivery of quality behavioral health services to Virginia Medicaid enrollees and work towards improving the overall health and well-being of Virginians. They also offer continuing education clock hours/credits for e-learning courses and host weekly Q&A sessions for providers to address their questions and issues.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe question asks about a \"Magellan of Virginia provider.\" To answer this, I need to identify what \"Magellan of Virginia\" refers to and who the provider is in the context of this information.\nTo analyze the question and the given information, I need to break down the components:\n1. Identify the term \"Magellan of Virginia\" in the context of the given information.\n2. Determine the nature of \"Magellan of Virginia\" (e.g., a company, an organization, a software, etc.).\n3. Identify who the provider of \"Magellan of Virginia\" is based on the information provided.\n4. Formulate an answer based on the identified provider.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 29.127, "generation_time_seconds": 23.8408, "selection_time_seconds": 5.2418, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 3405, 17064, 911, 279, 330, 30506, 84786, 315, 35899, 685, 9109, 1189, 2014, 4226, 419, 11, 582, 1184, 311, 10542, 279, 3151, 9109, 5815, 448, 6879, 84786, 304, 12989, 13, 576, 1376, 3793, 1588, 525, 330, 32915, 84786, 1, 323, 330, 80596, 9109, 2217, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1516