{"id": "51", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific benefits of a water pick mentioned in the passage.\nAnalyze the passage to identify the specific benefits of a water pick mentioned and ensure that each benefit is clearly stated or supported by examples, numbers, or comparisons within the text.\nReview the passage to confirm that all identified benefits of a water pick have been accounted for and that there are no additional benefits that should be included.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 23.237, "generation_time_seconds": 20.3934, "selection_time_seconds": 2.8345, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 2820, 7567, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 5435, 311, 1667, 264, 3015, 3735, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.9277, -0.0234, -0.0125, -0.2033, -3.0076, -0.0221, -0.1296, -0.0121, -0.0, -0.1711, -1.0283, -0.0, -0.6359, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1056, -0.0334, -28.75, -23.75, -8.8554], "cumulative_logprob": -69.6681, "norm_logp": -3.3175, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 21, "avg_logp": -3.3175299167633057}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_li