{"id": "408", "question": "how to make panko crumbs", "gt": "To make panko crumbs, preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Push torn pieces or chunks of white bread through the shredding disk of a food processor to make coarse crumbs. Spread the crumbs on a baking sheet and bake at 300 degrees F for 6 to 8 minutes, shaking the sheet twice during baking. Remove from the oven and cool completely.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nLook for specific instructions or recipes in the given passages that detail the process of making panko crumbs.\nIdentify the key ingredients and tools mentioned in the passages for making panko crumbs.\nLook for specific instructions or recipes in the given passages that detail the process of making panko crumbs.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 30.924, "generation_time_seconds": 27.3947, "selection_time_seconds": 3.5187, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [852, 279, 1887, 13966, 2567, 369, 3259, 281, 92852, 96577, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-5.4897, -0.0446, -4.117, -0.0709, -1.4148, -0.5069, -0.0062, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0238, -0.0507, -0.0001, -31.0417, -20.6252, -9.3835, -20.1042, -11.8871, -14.1792], "cumulative_logprob": -118.9459, "norm_logp": -6.6081, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 18, "avg_logp": -6.608095645904541}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [5501, 3410, 279, 5871, 7354, 476, 1995, 311, 6923, 279, 1790, 19819, 32711, 3019, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-4.0314, -0.0422, -0.0158, -8.7647, -0.9179, -0.2919, -0.8479, -0.4737, -2.9089, -0.0244, -0.0945, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0184, -0.002, -26.25, -20.4167], "cumulative_logprob": -65.1008, "norm_logp": 