{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 1: Identify the FIFA 16 skill moves that are relevant to Xbox One.\nStep 2: Research the key controls and techniques for executing these skill moves on Xbox One.\nStep 3: Provide step-by-step instructions for each skill move, referencing relevant in-game controls and visual cues.\nStep 4: Demonstrate the execution of each skill move through a visual guide or a list of actions that correspond to the skill moves on Xbox One.\nStep 5: Provide a visual guide or a list of actions that correspond to the skill moves on Xbox One, using screenshots or video clips if available, to help players understand the execution of each move.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 22.381, "generation_time_seconds": 19.2965, "selection_time_seconds": 3.0756, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 46769, 653, 537, 3410, 1995, 389, 1246, 311, 2736, 9947, 10797, 304, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645