{"id": "24", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is the answer to the question:\n\nMagellan of Virginia does offer continuing education clock hours/credits for their e-learning courses. According to passage 1, Magellan is approved to offer CE clock hours/credits by the American Psychological Association (APA) and the Association of Social Work Boards (ASWB).\n\nAdditionally, Magellan of Virginia has been selected by the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services (DMAS) to serve as the Behavioral Health Services Administrator (BHSA) for members enrolled in Virginia's Medicaid and FAMIS programs. This is mentioned in passage 2.\n\nFinally, Magellan of Virginia offers a Provider Q&A Session every Friday from 1 p.m. - 2:30 p.m. for providers to address their questions and issues. This is mentioned in passage 3.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe question asks about a \"Magellan of Virginia provider.\" To answer this, I need to identify what \"Magellan of Virginia\" refers to and who the provider is in the context of this information.\nTo analyze the question and the given information, I need to break down the components:\n1. Identify the term \"Magellan of Virginia\" in the context of the given information.\n2. Determine the nature of \"Magellan of Virginia\" (e.g., a company, an organization, a software, etc.).\n3. Identify who the provider of \"Magellan of Virginia\" is based on the information provided.\n4. Formulate an answer based on the identified provider.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 29.923, "generation_time_seconds": 23.8623, "selection_time_seconds": 6.0143, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [78