{"id": "75", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "Based on the passages provided, the steps to cook brats are as follows:\n\n1. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook. \n2. Combine beer and onions in a large pot and bring it to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\n3. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n4. In the meantime, preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.\n5. After simmering, remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and reduce the heat to low, continuing to cook the onions.\n6. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning occasionally, for about 10 to 14 minutes until they are browned evenly.\n7. Serve the bratwurst with the beer and onion mixture as a topping or side.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the main ingredients and tools required for cooking brats.\nIdentify the cooking method and any specific techniques needed for cooking brats.\nIdentify the specific preparation steps for brats, including marinating, seasoning, and cooking methods.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 22.094, "generation_time_seconds": 19.3679, "selection_time_seconds": 2.7164, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 943, 315, 1411, 1862, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.224, -0.0007, -0.0147, -1.0873, -0.0056, -0.0006, -0.1427, -2.1763, -0.0804, -0.0, -1.1278, -0.127, -0.0046, -31.0417, -2