{"id": "106", "question": "how the body systems work together", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the body systems work together as follows:\n\nThe skeletal, muscular, digestive, respiratory, circulatory, urinary, endocrine, lymphatic, immune, and reproductive systems all work together to help keep the body functioning normally. The urinary system helps to clean waste products from the other systems, while the respiratory system provides oxygen for all body parts and removes carbon dioxide from the other systems. The nervous system plays a crucial role in coordinating the functions of all the other systems.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe next logical reasoning step would be to identify the specific body systems mentioned in the passage and explain how they work together.\nThe next logical reasoning step would be to provide examples of how these systems interact in a real-world scenario or during a specific biological process.\nThe next logical reasoning step would be to provide examples of how the identified body systems interact in a real-world scenario or during a specific biological process, demonstrating the interconnectedness and cooperation among the systems.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages", "time_sec": 31.878, "generation_time_seconds": 28.8724, "selection_time_seconds": 2.9947, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 1790, 19819, 32711, 3019, 1035, 387, 311, 10542, 279, 3151, 2487, 5942, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 323, 10339, 1246, 807, 975, 3786, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645