{"id": "115", "question": "how are water shares transferred", "gt": "Based on the given passages, water shares can be transferred through the issuance of a new Water Stock Certificate to the new owner of record after paying a fee of $75.00. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate. The new owner must provide proof of ownership before a transfer can be processed. Additionally, an additional fee of $75.00 must be paid when filing a Lost Certificate Affidavit form, which is furnished by the company and must be signed and notarized.", "pred": "Based on the passage, water shares are transferred through the sale of the shares.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Based on the passage, water shares are transferred through the sale of the shares.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the passage, water shares are transferred through the sale of the shares.\nThe sale of water shares involves the transfer of ownership from the seller to the buyer.\nThe passage does not provide information on how the sale of water shares is executed, such as through a public auction, private negotiation, or any specific legal procedures.\n\nBased on the passage, water shares are transferred through the sale of the shares.", "time_sec": 19.625, "generation_time_seconds": 17.0424, "selection_time_seconds": 2.5751, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 9760, 14158, 315, 279, 21085, 429, 4263, 279, 1882, 315, 49951, 3015, 13248, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.8999, -0.0016, -0.0588, -4.2665, -3.2949, -0.1862, -0.0001, -0.0359, -0.0069, -0.0403, -0.0733, -1.5207, -0.0192, -0.0355, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0122, -0.0679], "cumulative_logprob": -11.52, "norm_logp": -0.64, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 18, "avg_logp": -0.639999270439148}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [