{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThere is no information in the given passage about why Snapchat might temporarily lock an account.\nThe given passage does not provide any reasons for Snapchat temporarily locking an account.\nThe given passage does not provide any reasons for Snapchat temporarily locking an account.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 22.186, "generation_time_seconds": 19.4801, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6979, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 4265, 481, 576, 4265, 518, 1424, 374, 264, 13340, 5296, 389, 264, 55179, 2692, 624, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 37427, 2986, 279, 2661, 1995, 481, 576, 21085, 1558, 537, 3410, 3151, 7966, 369, 279, 13340, 5296, 11, 1172, 429, 432, 374, 264, 13340, 5296, 624, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 21144, 4185, 11137, 481, 7718, 7966, 369, 55179, 9618, 1660, 27092, 16061, 2924, 5248,