{"id": "653", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "To properly clean your hair, first select the appropriate shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Ensure your water is warm but not too hot, and thoroughly wet your hair. Apply a bit of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair. If your hair is long, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles rather than piling it on your head. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove any tangles. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and let it stay on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Pat dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoid rubbing it with the towel as it can cause damage. For complete drying, a hair dryer can be used.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific parts of hair that need cleaning\nDetermine the frequency of cleaning required for each part.\nIdentify the specific cleaning methods suitable for each part of the hair.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 17.967, "generation_time_seconds": 15.0109, "selection_time_seconds": 2.9488, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 943, 315, 6869, 1660, 27722, 13, 33396, 6869, 4494, 1231, 1373, 2155, 15826, 5413, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.6873, -0.0016, -0.0679, -0.0003, -0.3433, -0.0051, -2.2811, -0.0016, -0.0141, -3.012, -0.4817, -1.136, -0.1245, -0.0102, -0.0002, -0.7683, -0.0011, -0.0123, -0.0025, -0.1466, -1.2852, -0.3124, -27.7083, -25.1042, -7.5081, -6.0444, -12.9167, -10.2435, -9.9344,