{"id": "77", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "To cook brats, follow these steps:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grate.\n3. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n4. Place the bratwurst in a large pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n5. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and continue cooking on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally.\n7. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the main ingredients and tools required for cooking brats.\nIdentify the cooking method and any specific techniques needed for cooking brats.\nIdentify the specific preparation steps for brats, including marinating, seasoning, and cooking methods.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 21.4, "generation_time_seconds": 18.9375, "selection_time_seconds": 2.4507, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 943, 315, 1411, 1862, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.224, -0.0007, -0.0147, -1.0873, -0.0056, -0.0006, -0.1427, -2.1763, -0.0804, -0.0, -1.1278, -0.127, -0.0046, -31.0417, -25.4167, -14.6876, -15.0, -11.3674, -10.5594, -12.5286, -11.4739, -10.029, -9.6128, -9.2024, -7.4707, -7.294, -6.8113, -6.0457, -6.0101, -6.1885, -6.581, -5.9439, -5.7393, -5.2228, -5.0542, -5.7729], "cumulative_logprob": -241.0456, "norm_logp": -6.6957, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens"