{"id": "251", "question": "how to grill pork chops, allrecipes.com", "gt": "To grill pork chops according to the instructions provided in Allrecipes.com, follow these steps: \n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat. \n2. Lightly oil the grate. \n3. Mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until well combined. \n4. Rinse pork chops and sprinkle them with the spice mixture on both sides. \n5. Massage the spice rub into the meat and let it stand for 10 minutes. \n6. Grill the chops over indirect heat for about 12 minutes per side, or until they are no longer pink inside.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the primary cooking method and any specific tools or equipment mentioned in the passage related to grilling pork chops.\nLook for any specific instructions or tips given in the passage about preparing pork chops for grilling.\nLook for any specific instructions or tips given in the passage about preparing pork chops for grilling.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.394, "generation_time_seconds": 16.818, "selection_time_seconds": 2.5671, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [3862, 374, 902, 9760, 1995, 304, 279, 3897, 21085, 911, 1081, 9400, 35067, 90078, 504, 2009, 49859, 905, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-6.7788, -0.1838, -0.0206, -3.382, -0.0182, -0.6952, -0.013, -1.6233, -0.3756, -1.2486, -0.4347, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -1.8241, -0.4289, -0.0033, -0.0006, -0.0036, -0.2846, -31.6667, -26.0417, -7.8417, -14.2058], "cumulative_logprob": -97.0748, "norm_logp": -4.0448, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 24, "avg_logp": -4.044775485992432}, {"beam": 0, "r