{"id": "264", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "pred": "Improved joint health, increased energy, and better skin health.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Improved joint health, increased energy, and better skin health.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nGiven the task, the logical next step would be to determine the specific benefits of MSM powder as described in the provided passages. The question asks for the benefits of MSM powder, so we need to identify what these benefits are based on the information given.\nAfter identifying the specific benefits of MSM powder as mentioned in the passages, the next logical step would be to organize these benefits into a coherent answer. This organization should highlight the key points and ensure that all the information is presented clearly and concisely.\nThe specific benefits of MSM powder as mentioned in the passages include improved joint health, increased energy, and better skin health.\n\nAnswer: Improved joint health, increased energy, and better skin health.", "time_sec": 24.174, "generation_time_seconds": 20.9194, "selection_time_seconds": 3.2443, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 1376, 7567, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 911, 67491, 16723, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1516