{"id": "573", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, one can use common household items that are effective against these pests. For instance, diatomaceous earth can be sprinkled in areas where mice frequent. This powder works by dehydrating the mice from the inside, causing them to die within a few days. Additionally, placing a few drops of peppermint oil in areas where mice are likely to be can also be effective. Peppermint oil has a strong odor that mice find unpleasant, which can驱赶them away. Alternatively, using a combination of mint leaves and cinnamon can also be effective. These ingredients have a strong scent that can deter mice. It's important to note that these methods are quick and easy to implement, making them ideal for getting rid of mice swiftly.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, one can use common household items that are effective against these pests. For instance, diatomaceous earth can be sprinkled in areas where mice frequent. This powder works by dehydrating the mice from the inside, causing them to die within a few days. Additionally, placing a few drops of peppermint oil in areas where mice are likely to be can also be effective. Peppermint oil has a strong odor that mice find unpleasant, which can驱赶them away. Alternatively, using a combination of mint leaves and cinnamon can also be effective. These ingredients have a strong scent that can deter mice. It's important to note that these methods are quick and easy to implement, making them ideal for getting rid of mice swiftly.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify common household items that can deter mice.\nSearch for information on methods that are effective and quick to implement.\nAnalyze the potential effectiveness of each identified household item against mice.\n\nTo quickly get rid of mice, one can use common household items that are effective against these pests. For instance, diatomaceous earth can be sprinkled in areas where mice frequent. This powder works by dehydrating the mice from the inside, causing them to die within a few days. Additionally, placing a few drops of peppermint oil in areas where mice are likely to be can also be effective. Peppermint oil has a strong odor that mice find unpleasant, which can驱赶them away. Alternatively, using a combination of mint leaves and cinnamon can also be effective. These ingredients have a strong scent that can deter mice. It's important to note that these methods are quick and easy to implement, making them ideal for getting rid of mice swiftly.", "time_sec": 27.056, "generation_time_seconds": 23.42, "selection_time_seconds": 3.6258, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 1447, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.9796, -1.0629, -0.0237, -0.0269, -0.5375, -Infinity, -33.125, -23.9583, -15.8539, -14.4208, -15.1741, -12.7216, -12.6597, -13.9897, -13.3647, -13.1278, -11.4621, -10.847, -8.6282, -6.6576, -6.3129, -6.4824, -6.2873, -6.2796, -7.7343, -7.1664, -6.8163, -6.8121], "cumulative_logprob": -Infinity, "norm_logp": -Infinity, "input_len": 140, "output_tokens": 28, "avg_logp": -Infinity}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [1249, 8253, 279, 1790,