{"id": "629", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some strategies for guarding a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities (Passage 1).\n2. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is important to stay close to them and create a barrier between them and the basket. These strategies can help limit their shooting opportunities and make it more difficult for them to score.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the strengths and weaknesses of the tall player.\nAnalyze the tall player's height, speed, and agility.\nAnalyze the tall player's shooting strength and positioning tendencies.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 26.115, "generation_time_seconds": 23.6035, "selection_time_seconds": 2.5038, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 1191, 553, 8660, 279, 2781, 594, 35386, 323, 43567, 13, 41102, 4217, 3545, 614, 458, 9423, 304, 41532, 287, 323, 22188, 14951, 4152, 311, 862, 2608, 13, 2014, 5546, 419, 11, 5244, 389, 1667, 697, 4628, 323, 66641, 311, 4717, 304, 4065, 315, 1105, 11, 26160, 1105, 504, 18739, 279, 14024, 6707, 13, 5443, 697, 11715, 311, 2504, 862, 14951, 323, 5344, 1105, 311, 1896, 5000, 11, 1550, 34381, 14951, 13, 86377, 264, 3347, 28931, 311, 4717, 61465, 323, 2952, 311, 6157, 2297, 17961, 13, 5443, 697, 2487, 311, 20245, 279, 4935, 504, 862