{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific health benefits mentioned in the passages related to jalapenos.\nExtract details from the passages that directly state benefits of jalapenos on health.\nAnalyze the specific examples, numbers, or comparisons provided in the passages to determine the health benefits of jalapenos.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.999, "generation_time_seconds": 17.3413, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6486, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1887, 8544, 315, 279, 3405, 624, 785, 3405, 17064, 911, 279, 2820, 7567, 315, 75974, 391, 70870, 382, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.2704, -0.0027, -0.1507, -0.0004, -0.0203, -0.0252, -3.2975, -0.4523, -0.1885, -0.0009, -0.2203, -0.8309, -0.0311, -0.2523, -0.9265, -0.0013, -0.0156, -0.0286, 0.0, -0.0074, -0.0001, -0.0004, -0.0029, -0.1279, -Infinity, -39.5833, -26.3542, -11.2247, -9.8203, -15.2513, -13.7501, -12.0834, -12.0901, -10.862, -10.0191], "cumulative_logprob": -Infinity, "norm_logp": -Infinity, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 35, "avg_logp": -Infinity}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 21085, 1558, 537,