{"id": "265", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe given passage does not provide enough information to answer the question about the benefits of MSM powder.\nThe passage should be analyzed for any relevant information regarding the benefits of MSM powder.\nThe passages do not contain any information about the benefits of MSM powder.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 17.794, "generation_time_seconds": 15.1255, "selection_time_seconds": 2.6597, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 5435, 311, 67491, 16723, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.4031, -0.001, -0.0617, -0.3903, -0.0842, -2.2084, -0.0722, -0.0, -0.4772, -1.3591, 0.0, -0.0046, -0.0001, -0.0254, -0.0069], "cumulative_logprob": -6.0942, "norm_logp": -0.4063, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 15, "avg_logp": -0.4062856435775757}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 438, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.4031, -0.001, -0.0617, -0.3903, -0.0842, -0.1251, -0.0008, -0.0009, -2.0666, -0.4561, -0.0125, -0.0, -1.1191, -0.0296