{"id": "425", "question": "what is a upc description", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, an UPDescription is:\n\n1. A barcode symbology used for tracking trade items in stores, consisting of 12 numeric digits that are uniquely assigned to each trade item. (Passage 1)\n2. A process involving receiving a specimen bottle from a member, ensuring it contains a minimum of 30 milliliters of urine, initialing the label in the member's presence, and verifying the information on the label and DD Form 2624 (a military form). (Passage 2)\n3. A barcode partner that provides GS1 Originated UPC and EAN codes, as well as a toll-free number and positive customer reviews. (Passage 3)\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the provided passages for any mention of \"UPC\" or \"UPC description.\" Identify any context or definitions given for these terms.\nLook for any specific examples, numbers, or comparisons related to \"UPC\" or \"UPC description\" within the text.\nLook for any specific examples, numbers, or comparisons related to \"UPC\" or \"UPC description\" within the text.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.571, "generation_time_seconds": 17.0383, "selection_time_seconds": 2.5254, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3897, 21085, 369, 894, 2118, 17473, 476, 10295, 315, 264, 95129, 4008, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.3704, -0.1174, -0.002