{"id": "464", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "pred": "The benefits of cupping massage include pain relief, improved circulation, muscle relaxation, and reduced inflammation.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Answer: The benefits of cupping massage include pain relief, improved circulation, muscle relaxation, and reduced inflammation.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 1: Identify the purpose of the passage.\nThe purpose of the passage is to describe the benefits of cupping massage.\nStep 2: Extract relevant information about the benefits of cupping massage from the passage.\nThe passage should mention specific benefits of cupping massage, such as pain relief, improved circulation, muscle relaxation, and reduced inflammation.\nStep 3: Analyze the extracted information to determine the benefits of cupping massage based on the given passage.\n\nAnswer: The benefits of cupping massage include pain relief, improved circulation, muscle relaxation, and reduced inflammation.", "time_sec": 20.753, "generation_time_seconds": 18.1738, "selection_time_seconds": 2.5701, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 21085, 1558, 537, 3410, 1995, 911, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.6008, -1.7744, -0.0713, -0.0704, -0.0, -0.09, -1.2008, -0.2158, -0.0104, -0.0103, -0.0, -0.0024, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0045, -