{"id": "479", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "gt": "To change your US postal address, you can visit the official website of the U.S. Postal Service, fill out an online form, or contact their call center. The process is fast and versatile, allowing you to notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the USPS. It's important to note that you can also use this feature to have your business mail forwarded to a new address due to a permanent move or temporary relocation. The process involves submitting either an online form or filling out and submitting a physical form at any U.S. Post Office.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific procedures or requirements for changing an address with the U.S. Postal Service.\nResearch the specific forms and methods the U.S. Postal Service offers for address changes.\nLook up the official U.S. Postal Service website for the most current and detailed information on address changes.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.993, "generation_time_seconds": 16.6747, "selection_time_seconds": 3.3032, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 4494, 315, 2297, 315, 2621, 429, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 13469, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.2582, -0.001, -0.0244, -0.3188, -3.4539, -0.0002, -0.6251, -0.0063, -0.0029, -1.0813, -1.0398, -0.0062, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3018, -0.0899, -0.004, -29.5833, -26.9792], "cumulative_logprob": -65.7765, "norm_logp": -3.1322, "input_len": 141, "output_tokens": 21, "avg_logp": -3.1322247982025146}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 21085, 1558, 537, 3410, 894, 3151, 1995, 911, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 476, 1001