{"id": "501", "question": "factors that cause oily skin", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the factors that cause oily skin are primarily genetic/hereditary factors and hormonal shifts in the body. Diet and poor hygiene/topical applications have a limited effect on the oiliness of the skin. Combination skin, which is a mix of oily and dry/normal areas, can also contribute to oily skin in certain areas such as the T-zone.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe reasoning steps are:\n1. Identify the passage discussing factors that cause oily skin.\n2. Extract specific factors mentioned in the passage.\n3. Compare the factors mentioned with known causes of oily skin.\n4. Provide a comprehensive list of factors causing oily skin based on the information given.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 21.746, "generation_time_seconds": 18.7283, "selection_time_seconds": 3.0098, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 1447, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.5809, -0.9601, -0.0539, -0.0908, -0.4698, -Infinity, -32.5, -23.125, -15.2283, -9.6364, -13.6989, -13.0898, -12.7391, -13.0243, -12.5883, -12.7138, -11.8786, -11.4674, -9.2716, -7.2326, -5.9713, -5.6973, -5.7049, -6.7382, -7.9843, -7.6009, -6.5251, -6.4401, -6.0989, -7.3274, -7.5478], "cumulative_logprob": -Infinity, "norm_logp": -Infinity, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 31, "avg_logp": -Infinity}, {"beam": 0, "rollout": 1, "token_ids": [2082, 55856, 279, 1467, 311, 