{"id": "630", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is how to guard a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when guarding them near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player.\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is essential to stay close to them, move quickly laterally to maintain position, and use a defensive strategy such as keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "pred": "Tall players in basketball often have an advantage in physical attributes such as height, reach, and jumping ability. When guarding a tall person, the defender should focus on exploiting these advantages to create mismatches or advantages during defense. Key strategies may include using the tall player's height to block high shots or passes, using their reach to contest shots from the outside, and taking advantage of their jumping ability to contest layups or rebound. Additionally, the defender should consider using a mix of man-to-man and zone defense to keep the tall player off balance and to force them to make difficult decisions or shots.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Tall players in basketball often have an advantage in physical attributes such as height, reach, and jumping ability. When guarding a tall person, the defender should focus on exploiting these advantages to create mismatches or advantages during defense. Key strategies may include using the tall player's height to block high shots or passes, using their reach to contest shots from the outside, and taking advantage of their jumping ability to contest layups or rebound. Additionally, the defender should consider using a mix of man-to-man and zone defense to keep the tall player off balance and to force them to make difficult decisions or shots.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAnalyze the specific advantages and disadvantages of guarding a tall person in basketball.\nConsider the physical attributes of a tall player, such as height, reach, and jumping ability, and how these affect their defensive capabilities.\nExamine how a tall player's height and reach can be exploited by the defender to create mismatches or advantages during defense.\n\nTall players in basketball often have an advantage in physical attributes such as height, reach, and jumping ability. When guarding a tall person, the defender should focus on exploiting these advantages to create mismatches or advantages during defense. Key strategies may include using the tall player's height to block high shots or passes, using their reach to contest shots from the outside, and taking advantage of their jumping ability to contest layups or rebound. Additionally, the defender should consider using a mix of man-to-man and zone defense to keep the tall player off balance and to force them to make difficult decisions or shots.", "time_sec": 38.669, "generation_time_seconds": 35.4648, "selection_time_seconds": 3.1948, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 8660, 279, 6961, 8201, 429, 1281, 264, 2781, 16217, 374, 16587, 13, 41102, 4217, 3545, 614, 5021, 48595, 11, 892, 646, 1281, 432, 803, 17003, 311, 2504, 862, 14951, 476, 28639, 16211, 13, 22406, 11, 16217, 4217, 1231, 614, 264, 5080, 12140, 7784, 323, 646, 5545, 279, 14024, 803, 6707, 11, 3259, 432, 15750, 311, 10505, 1105, 304, 279, 6177, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.8057, -0.3248, -0.0002, -0.0002, -0.0127, -0.0083, -0.0, -0.0988, -5.1335, -0.9494, -0.2208, -0.2726, -8.6208, -0.1551, -3.1982, -0.5632, -0.025, -0.