{"id": "656", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with water.\n2. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n3. Apply a conditioner and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n4. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n5. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles.\n\nAdditionally, it is recommended to use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair after washing, and to be gentle when handling wet hair to prevent damage.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific cleaning methods mentioned in the passage, such as using shampoo, water, or other cleaning products.\nDetermine if the cleaning methods mentioned are specific to different hair types or if they are general for all hair types.\nLook for any mention of frequency or timing for when to clean the hair.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 23.817, "generation_time_seconds": 21.0328, "selection_time_seconds": 2.7746, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [1249, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1191, 553, 27686, 432, 448, 264, 23034, 61932, 13, 5443, 81280, 365, 2178, 3015, 323, 326, 1856, 705, 697, 64326, 29273, 11, 30426, 279, 19703, 13, 57368, 325, 26364, 311, 4057, 894, 48132, 13, 1752, 3694, 2453, 11, 2908, 1667, 264, 19497, 7766, 61932, 3055, 264, 2003, 311, 4057, 1985, 85665, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.729, -0.0255, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0008, -1.0399, -0.0189, -1.3705, -0.9812, -0.0461, -0.0169, -0.5724, -0.0205, -1.2048, -0.2143, -0.2344, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0017, -0.4104,