{"id": "679", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAnalyze the specific benefits and side effects mentioned in the given passages related to clove tea.\nIdentify any specific health benefits or side effects of clove tea that are discussed in the passages.\nIdentify the specific health benefits or side effects of clove tea that are discussed in the passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.625, "generation_time_seconds": 16.6326, "selection_time_seconds": 2.9841, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 3897, 46769, 311, 10542, 3151, 1995, 911, 279, 7567, 323, 3108, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.6452, -0.0105, -0.742, -0.085, -1.0693, -0.0128, -0.4569, -1.5211, -0.1339, -0.0147, -0.0003, -0.002, -0.0083, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0157, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0