{"id": "735", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "SMS stands for Short Message Service, commonly referred to as a text message, and allows you to send a text message of up to 160 characters to another device. MMS, which stands for Multimedia Messaging Service, is an evolution of SMS. It allows you to send messages that include pictures, video, or audio content to another device. MMS messages can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB. SMS is restricted to sending text-only messages, whereas MMS allows a combination of text, pictures, sounds, and videos.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_gd", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific features that distinguish SMS and MMS in terms of content and functionality.\nIdentify any examples, numbers, or comparisons provided in the passages that highlight the differences between SMS and MMS.\nIdentify the specific examples, numbers, or comparisons provided in the passages that highlight the differences between SMS and MMS.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 19.272, "generation_time_seconds": 16.902, "selection_time_seconds": 2.3623, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 4419, 429, 32037, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 304, 3793, 315, 2213, 323, 14944, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.0673, -0.1174, -0.0013, -1.4311, -0.666, -7.4625, -0.8481, -0.0001, -2.0868, -0.0, 0.0, -1.8445